stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> proposed: StepProposed
  proposed --> awaiting_auth: 需授权(按四档)
  awaiting_auth --> cancelled: 拒绝/撤权
  awaiting_auth --> running: 已授权+已确认(绑定对象+版本)
  proposed --> running: 低风险/已允许
  running --> succeeded: Receipt(ok)
  running --> failed: Receipt(err)
  running --> cancelled: 用户停止
  running --> unknown: 断连/超时
  unknown --> succeeded: 核对账本/服务端
  unknown --> failed: 核对
  succeeded --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
